  <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
  <p class="lede tight">A general notice about how LivedHere works, what reviews are, and how to report a problem.</p>
  <p class="muted">Last updated: November 2026. This page is a general notice. It is not legal advice, and it is not a contract written for your specific situation.</p>

  <h2>An online forum for user reviews</h2>
  <p>LivedHere is an online forum where people share written reviews of homes they have rented or owned. Those reviews are user-generated content: they are the opinions of the individual users who wrote them, not the opinions of LivedHere.</p>

  <h2>We do not verify that reviews are accurate</h2>
  <p>LivedHere does not verify that a review is accurate, truthful, or complete, or that the reviewer actually lived at the property. Please use your own judgment, and do not treat a review as a statement of fact from LivedHere.</p>
  <p>A “Verified renter” or “Verified owner” badge only means a moderator reviewed a document the user uploaded. It is not a guarantee that the review is true, that the dates are right, or that the person lived at the home.</p>

  <h2>No warranties — information is provided “as is”</h2>
  <p>LivedHere and the information on it are provided “as is,” without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not promise that the site, or any review, is accurate, complete, reliable, or up to date, or that the site will always be available or error-free.</p>

  <h2>Not legal, financial, or real estate advice</h2>
  <p>Nothing on LivedHere is legal, financial, real estate, or other professional advice. If you need advice about a home, a lease, a purchase, or a dispute, please talk to a qualified professional.</p>

  <h2>Your responsibility for what you post</h2>
  <p>If you post a review or other content, you are responsible for it. You agree not to post anything you know is false, defamatory, or misleading, and not to post private information about other people — for example a name, phone number, email address, or other details that could identify a private person who did not choose to be identified.</p>

  <h2>How to report a review or ask for removal</h2>
  <p>Anyone can report a review, including property owners. Use the <strong>Report</strong> button on the review (you will need an account). You can explain why you think it should be removed — for example, if you believe it is false, includes private information, or is otherwise inappropriate.</p>
  <p>LivedHere may hide, remove, or decline to publish content at its discretion. There are no email notifications; check the site for updates.</p>

  <h2>Platform protections</h2>
  <p>LivedHere is a platform for third-party content posted by users. As such, it relies on protections that apply to online platforms that host user-generated content, including Section 230 of the Communications Decency Act.</p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>To the fullest extent allowed by law, LivedHere and the people who operate it are not liable for losses or damages that arise from your use of the site, from relying on a review, or from content posted by users. This includes direct or indirect losses, even if we were told that those losses might happen. Some places do not allow certain limitations, so part of this may not apply to you.</p>
